" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No good cleaner works alone! Gather your crew and take off together to traverse the vast expanse of the universe. Complete missions, tackle challenges, and collect resources to upgrade your gear, acquiring more powerful tools to fight the chaos! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2173150/extras/sadasd.png?t=1746731789\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2173150/extras/AliensCleanerCompany.gif?t=1746731789\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Abandoned space stations hide dark secrets... And among them \u2013 dangerous, terrifying creatures! Dive into their world, uncover hidden weaknesses, and face unknown threats in a fight for survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2173150/extras/ghjghj-sad.png?t=1746731789\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2173150/extras/Physicsr.gif?t=1746731789\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Physics, physics, physics... The entire game is built around delightful, dynamic physics! Stack towers made of alien body parts, spill water from a bucket, or watch as trash flies out of boxes, leaving a mess all over the floor. Every action brings a new, fun twist to the chaos!</p>","developers":["Wildflame Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2173150/572d31ff2c7ad270460bec5541867415b11c933a/header.jpg?t=1746731789","is_free":true,"linux_requirements"